### Enhancements

* Map conda's disabled channel priority to rattler's `VersionFirst` mode instead of `Disabled`. The highest version still wins regardless of the channel, and a tie between candidates with the same version now goes to the higher-priority channel before build numbers are compared, matching the `classic` and `libmamba` solvers. (#252)

